    <Label Name="Title" Style="GalleryTitle" Text="Ellipse and Its Evolute" DecimalsToShow="2" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="57.5" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
    <Label Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="Point L runs around an ellipse. At every position there is a circle that hugs the curve best, and M is its center.\n\nAs L travels, M traces the star-shaped curve inside: the evolute of the ellipse.\n\nDrag the yellow point to move L. Drag a and b to reshape the ellipse." DecimalsToShow="2" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="105.5" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
